"  agent_subject_id: 2 # type=agent entity; default 2\n"
msgstr ""
"worlds:\n"
"  user_subject_id: 1 # type=user entity; default 1\n"
"  agent_subject_id: 2 # type=agent entity; default 2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:76
msgid ""
"`user_world_id` / `agent_world_id` are derived at Habitat boot from each "
"subject's `default_private_world_id` (see [`entity-model.md`](entity-"
"model.md))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:78
msgid ""
"Each row stores `recipient_kind` (`user` | `agent`) and `recipient_id` "
"(entity id string). Unconfigured installs default to subject ids `1` / `2`."
msgstr ""
"每行存储 `recipient_kind`（`user` | `agent`）与 `recipient_id`（实体 id 字符"
"串）。未配置的安装默认使用 subject id `1` / `2`。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/notifications.md:85
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Writer                                  | Typical recipient     |\n"
#| "| --------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n"
#| "| Cron success (when `notify_on_success`) | **both** user + agent |\n"
#| "| Cron failure                            | **both** user + agent |\n"
